msgstr "BuddyNext設定を検索"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2630
msgid "Search settings (Cmd/Ctrl + K)…"
msgstr "設定を検索 (Cmd/Ctrl + K)…"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2726
msgid "Core (always on)"
msgstr "コア（常に有効）"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2727
msgid "Community features"
msgstr "コミュニティ機能"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2728
msgid "Power-user integrations"
msgstr "上級者向け連携"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2738
msgid ""
"You can enable or disable everything except core features from this tab - "
"changes apply immediately on save."
msgstr ""
"このタブでは、コア機能以外のすべてを有効または無効にできます。変更は保存する"
"と直ちに反映されます。"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2748
msgid "Search features..."
msgstr "機能を検索..."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2749
msgid "Search features"
msgstr "機能を検索"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2751
